<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALY BEAT GEORGIA 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALY BEAT GEORGIA 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>PERUGIA, Italy 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy beat Georgia 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a World Cup European group two soccer</p>
<p>qualifier on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Scorer:</p>
<p>Italy - Fabrizio Ravanelli (42nd minute)</p>
